# POST /api/owners — complete code path

The endpoint is served by the **V1** controller. `OwnerRestControllerV1` implements the generated `OwnersApi` interface, whose `addOwner` default method carries the mapping `POST /owners` (class-level `@RequestMapping("/api")` → effective path `/api/owners`).

