## Derivation/uniqueness helpers invoked by the controller (§1 lines 106-122)

All in `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/`:

- **`DailyRegistrationLimit.isReached`** (`DailyRegistrationLimit.java:24-30`): true when ≥ `LIMIT=100` existing owners have today's (business-day-rolled) `registrationDate` → 429.
- **`HouseholdDuplicates.assignHousehold`** (`HouseholdDuplicates.java:24-26`): stamps `householdId` = first 12 hex of SHA-256 over `"V2|"+normLastName+"|"+postcode`. (Its `isRejectedDuplicate` method exists at lines 32-38 but is **not called** by the controller.)
- **`IdentityKey.isDuplicate`** (`IdentityKey.java:38-41`): hard duplicate when any existing owner shares the SHA-256 identity key over `"V2|"+telephone+"|"+lowerEmail+"|"+soundex(lastName)` (`of` at lines 21-35) → 409.
- **`CityCapacity.isAtCapacity`** (`CityCapacity.java:21-26`): true when the candidate's city already holds ≥ `LIMIT=50` owners (case-insensitive) → 409.
- **`PossibleDuplicates.matchId`** (`PossibleDuplicates.java:18-33`): soft-duplicate match id — earliest existing owner with same Soundex(lastName) and same postcode but different identity key; null when `sharesHousehold` is true.
- **`Namesakes.count`** (`Namesakes.java:17-22`): count of existing owners with same first+last name (case-insensitive).
- **`CustomerCodes.build`** (`CustomerCodes.java:24-31`): memberId `<REGION>V2 + FY(2-digit) + HASH8 + Luhn`, then de-duplicated against existing memberIds (lines 34-44). Uses `FiscalYear.of` (`FiscalYear.java:18`), `CheckDigit.luhn` (`CheckDigit.java:13-28`), region from postcode/city (lines 56-70).
- **`MembershipCap.of`** (`MembershipCap.java:22-30`): one above the max `MembershipLevel` among non-deleted household peers, else null. `MembershipLevel.of/points` at `MembershipLevel.java:19-29`.
- **`CityCapacityWarning.isApproaching`** (`CityCapacityWarning.java:24-29`): true when city holds ≥ `WARN_THRESHOLD=40` and < 50.
- **`BulkSignupWarning.isTriggered`** (`BulkSignupWarning.java:24-30`): true when > `THRESHOLD=80` owners registered today; applied to the response DTO only (not persisted).
- **`Soundex.code`** (`Soundex.java:16-37`): used by IdentityKey and PossibleDuplicates.

